<p><strong>Item:</strong> SCP-999</p>
<p><strong>Tissue Test Record:</strong><br />
N/A</p>
<strong>Termination Test Record:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Requires&nbsp;Level&nbsp;4&nbsp;and&nbsp;above&nbsp;security&nbsp;clearance</a></div>
