N/A</p>
<p><strong>Termination Test Record:</strong><br />
SCP-5942 was restrained in the testing area and the laser was introduced. Laser began cutting into SCP-5942's back; command room emergency shutter was closed.</p>
<div class="blockquote">
<p>&lt;Begin Log&gt;<br />
